OL,4,BSouthampton give head coach Eckert new 
OL,5,Bdeal                                   
OL,6,GSouthampton head coach Tonda Eckert    
OL,7,Ghas signed a new contract at the       
OL,8,GChampionship club until 2029.          
OL,10,FThe 33-year-old German's existing deal 
OL,11,Fwas expiring at the end of this season 
OL,12,Fafter being handed the role            
OL,13,Fpermanently last December.             
OL,15,FEckert's future was thrown into doubt  
OL,16,Fover the summer, having been at the    
OL,17,Fcentre of an investigation by the      
OL,18,FFootball Association over his role in  
OL,19,Fthe 'Spygate' scandal.                 
